{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"b8e237b6-9f9b-4358-ac4b-2968311bca4c","status":"SUCCESS","response":"I have diagnosed why the job was failing silently, applied the fixes to the configuration and wrapper script, and documented the causes in [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-Sof5YA/ANSWER.md).\n\n### Root Causes\n1. **The job *was* running, but `claude` could not access Keychain credentials**: [launchctl-print.txt](file:///tmp/h-Sof5YA/launchctl-print.txt#L27-L28) shows `runs = 6` and `last exit code = 1`. Because `USER` was omitted from `EnvironmentVariables` in [com.vk.nightly-review.plist](file:///tmp/h-Sof5YA/Library/LaunchAgents/com.vk.nightly-review.plist#L23-L27), `claude` failed immediately on every run with `Not logged in · Please run /login` (recorded in [nightly-review.err](file:///tmp/h-Sof5YA/Library/Logs/nightly-review.err#L1-L12)).\n2. **`zsh` killed the script before the failure notification could run**: On line 19 of [nightly-review.zsh](file:///tmp/h-Sof5YA/bin/nightly-review.zsh#L18-L24), the script assigned `status=$?`. In `zsh`, `status` is a read-only built-in variable, so assigning to it immediately terminated the script (`read-only variable: status`) right before the `if` block that calls [notify.sh](file:///tmp/h-Sof5YA/bin/notify.sh).\n3. **Unclosed `stdin` / multi-line prompt argument**: Passing multi-line `$PROMPT` as an argument to `claude -p` without piping via `stdin` (or closing `stdin` with `\u003c /dev/null`) is brittle under `launchd`.\n\n### Fixes Applied\n- **[com.vk.nightly-review.plist](file:///tmp/h-Sof5YA/Library/LaunchAgents/com.vk.nightly-review.plist#L23-L29)**: Added `USER` (`vk`) to `EnvironmentVariables` so the headless CLI can resolve its Keychain login.\n- **[nightly-review.zsh](file:///tmp/h-Sof5YA/bin/nightly-review.zsh#L18-L29)**:\n  - Replaced `status=$?` with `rc=$?`.\n  - Piped `$PROMPT` via `stdin` (`print -r -- \"$PROMPT\" | claude -p --output-format text \u003e \"$OUT\"`).\n  - Logged run duration and verified `$OUT` is non-empty (`[ ! -s \"$OUT\" ]`) before reporting success.\n- **[ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-Sof5YA/ANSWER.md)**: Created with a full breakdown of the causes and fixes.\n","duration_seconds":69.940784,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":32827,"output_tokens":2839,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":115020,"total_tokens":35666}}}
